  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-joins-the-game-v1-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "66482c988b188b8894243fdffe34f67a31130f3bbe9333f4c2e380d7d83d9868",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "27679508df2f1503931be5e09ec837e97c8322f8cc4303620a0725956d93112d",
      "text": "悟空想一起玩",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "00c7643a6c167d287a0ce2e6699afc6d942f747816731444192d3a4eeb0fa5a7",
      "text": "天气真好。\n八戒、玉兔和敖丙在玩球，\n他们围成一圈坐着。\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6e0ab7f6992cbdffccb85b7b5fa344bec93a1c2ff49610f23a790d04186a6d28",
      "text": "八戒把球滚出去：\n“滚给玉兔！”\n玉兔接住了：\n“滚给敖丙！”\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8a054bea979dd1dc5cd50ac610bd0dcdecf7c845fa68322240a80f996074abb0",
      "text": "悟空躲在桃树后面看。\n他好想一起玩呀！\n脚尖踮呀踮。\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "81c0c4c607145862c451d1aa6541cb469025e1f4d7b89de386efb96b3944f959",
      "text": "球正滚向敖丙，\n悟空一下冲进圈里，把球抱住：\n“轮到我啦！”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d33cdce3511b3bd97d7da256df9719a68f15d4b4edc9e3096971af4a83bc2d6a",
      "text": "游戏停下来了。\n敖丙的手还空空地伸着。\n八戒轻声说：“刚才轮到敖丙呀。”\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1bfc7c20d91ebc6215c5bbfd172a09885fe49d18ef9b1b8f6b1d02f8f9b869ac",
      "text": "悟空的脸一下子红了。\n他把球放下，\n走到桃树下的长凳上坐着。\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f6eaeb31c9965b747b1c7b99a18c61d9b102a37e90770c0ac8dd02f42ba7f731",
      "text": "沙僧提着小篮子走过来。\n悟空说：“我想一起玩，\n可是不知道怎么加入。”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "72226e6bdce592c8841f654de3a746e0e8c427e038a4f762176a00569a5cc4eb",
      "text": "沙僧指指长凳：\n“我可以坐在你旁边吗？”\n问完，他就静静地等。\n悟空说：“可以！”\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8b21c10557495f270e95f6b8d09cac52990034f7f36bdca80c64ab9b6a39c48e",
      "text": "沙僧说：“看一看，问一问，\n等一等。”\n他们一起看大家玩：\n滚出去，接住，再滚出去。\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5baa4acc8dce75615de2c20e348e476f83bc2ecfd31bafbf9103e7eca239883a",
      "text": "悟空走到圆垫边，\n等球被接住了，\n才开口问：“我也可以一起玩吗？”\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a82dc49484b38ca74636e70718a98b65c9a1a4badb919712fe37a2a711c78c0e",
      "text": "玉兔说：“好呀！等这一轮。”\n悟空就等着，\n看球滚到八戒那儿。\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ae7d5a175df73ca81f3d3d76d7235b4d633e317740d708b6ec72e79d141e74f1",
      "text": "八戒往旁边挪一挪：\n“悟空，坐这儿！”\n圆圈里变成四个人啦。\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5f5e4b66a3e3324833de6a67546d017442347a3734d0a6b8b0256068b0ecb561",
      "text": "悟空接住了球。\n他想了想，把球滚出去：\n“滚给敖丙！”\n敖丙笑了。\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1c0a17d23ba9b5df6fd2eba08a965b72a5792aafc1d558d747d59fee1fa2c857",
      "text": "悟空看见沙僧还坐在长凳上，\n跑过去问：\n“沙僧，你也来一起玩吗？”\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7e8eae26e8e7521ac08958d92b2ec8514847cee9539f47ca6738f7ff77a1c0a2",
      "text": "沙僧慢慢地把球滚出去，\n球停在悟空的脚尖前。\n八戒说：“这是一个想睡觉的球！”\n五个好朋友笑哈哈，接着玩。\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
